    "Description": "GNU Aspell is a spell checker designed to eventually replace Ispell. It can either be used as a library or as an independent spell checker.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* aspell: aspell: Arbitrary code execution via crafted dictionary file (CVE-2026-103658)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
